{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45560","headline":"蒿里 · 贯休","name":"蒿里","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兔不迟，乌更急，但恐穆王八骏，着鞭不及。\n所以蒿里，坟出蕺蕺。\n气凌云天，龙腾凤集。\n尽爲风消土吃，狐掇蚁拾，黄金不啼玉不泣。\n白杨骚屑，乱风愁月。\n折碑石人，莽秽榛没。\n牛羊窸窣，时见牧童儿，弄枯骨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45560.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45560","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}